hurchStochastic}(X)\\iff\\forall m\\;\\bigl((\\operatorname{SimpleMartingale}(m)\\land\\operatorname{PartialComputableReal}_{2^{&lt;\\omega}}(m)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(m)=2^{&lt;\\omega})\\Rightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{PartialSucceeds}(m,X)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ChurchStochastic}(X)\\iff\\forall m\\;\\bigl((\\operatorname{SimpleMartingale}(m)\\land\\operatorname{PartialComputableReal}_{2^{&lt;\\omega}}(m)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(m)=2^{&lt;\\omega})\\Rightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{PartialSucceeds}(m,X)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ChurchStochastic}(X)\\iff\\forall m\\;\\bigl((\\operatorname{AlmostSimpleMartingale}(m)\\land\\operatorname{PartialComputableReal}_{2^{&lt;\\omega}}(m)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(m)=2^{&lt;\\omega})\\Rightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{PartialSucceeds}(m,X)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ChurchStochastic}(X)\\iff\\forall m\\;\\bigl((\\operatorname{AlmostSimpleMartingale}(m)\\land\\operatorname{PartialComputableReal}_{2^{&lt;\\omega}}(m)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(m)=2^{&lt;\\omega})\\Rightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{PartialSucceeds}(m,X)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VMCWStochastic}(X)\\iff\\forall m\\;\\bigl((\\operatorname{SimpleMartingale}(m)\\land\\operatorname{PartialComputableReal}_{2^{&lt;\\omega}}(m))\\Rightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{PartialSucceeds}(m,X)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{VMCWStochastic}(X)\\iff\\forall m\\;\\bigl((\\operatorname{SimpleMartingale}(m)\\land\\operatorname{PartialComputableReal}_{2^{&lt;\\omega}}(m))\\Rightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{PartialSucceeds}(m,X)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VMCWStochastic}(X)\\iff\\forall m\\;\\bigl((\\operatorname{AlmostSimpleMartingale}(m)\\land\\operatorname{PartialComputableReal}_{2^{&lt;\\omega}}(m))\\Rightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{PartialSucceeds}(m,X)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{VMCWStochastic}(X)\\iff\\forall m\\;\\bigl((\\operatorname{AlmostSimpleMartingale}(m)\\land\\operatorname{PartialComputableReal}_{2^{&lt;\\omega}}(m))\\Rightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{PartialSucceeds}(m,X)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个等价式只量化部分实值函数，直接调用已定义谓词。总定义域与Church分支对应；部分域与VMCW分支对应。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：Theorem 12.3.4; Lemma 12.3.2 and Corollary 12.3.3。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-church-stochastic","status":"resolved","id":"00b50f9887ef4bac","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-church-stochastic]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-simple-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"f00d8c022b23a0a5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-simple-martingale]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-partial-computable-random","status":"resolved","id":"a0abc398f6f3118e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-partial-computable-random]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-partial-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"df8eac4626d45afe","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","head